{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Hats & Headwear|$Hirdsman's Helmet}}

==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Wrought Iron+ _{q}Wood}{2} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[3]{Strength*Carpentry*Smithing}</math>.

